; processes player input, unless GUI_Delay is set, in
; which	case it	will simply decrement it by one
; returns with the index of the	last activated control,
; if any, but can also return zero to indicate no valid
; input, -1 for	an escape sequence if allowed, or the
; negative control index in very special cases
;
; WARNING: edit	boxes do not return control until they
; lose focus once they have it
; Attributes: bp-based frame
; int __far Get_Input(void)
proc Get_Input far
