; draws	a unit enchantment outline on whatever image is
; loaded into the GUI_SmallWork_IMG@ work area,
; typically a combat figure, using the passed realm
; color	index (Chaos-Death-Life-Nature-Sorcery)
; Attributes: bp-based frame
